{{DISPLAYTITLE:Equipment}}
In Mobile Legends: Bang Bang, heroes can buy items (also known as "Equipment") in-game. Each hero can only have six (6) equipments in their inventory. Equipment have tiers like they do in most MOBA games, and you can get higher tier equipment by buying lower tier equipment. They offer distinct passive and abilities along with extra attributes. Below are the equipment as of [[Patch 2.1.40]].

